{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/d2d6eb130ed090956d6e9ea57442c5c9.avif?t=1773286131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras_big/d2d6eb130ed090956d6e9ea57442c5c9.avif?t=1773286131 width=800 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A zen roguelike deckbuilder centered around 'making tens'.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape cards, make tens, chain, and watch the magic happen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft Your Unique Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Runes + 7 Shaping skills + 100+ Charmstones = Ever-changing strategic combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the 6 distinct <strong>Runes</strong> as the core of your build: will you pick the <i>Wind</i> Rune for generous rewards through quick decisions? Or the <i>Tree</i> Rune for a slow-and-steady, cumulative strategy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use '<strong>Shaping</strong>' skills to alter the cards, and shape your strategy with 100+ '<strong>Charmstones</strong>' with various effects. Stack, combine, trigger chains, and discover your own go-to builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ever-changing Adventure</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated hands and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Challenge</strong> <strong>Mode</strong>, face random challenges that shake up the rules.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realm of Zen</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist gentle visual design + original soothing soundtracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/0be4341a2c739cd134d0656aa7da7194.avif?t=1773286131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras_big/0be4341a2c739cd134d0656aa7da7194.avif?t=1773286131 width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist PhiloDeka now and embark on a zen journey of cards and strategy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/1f2984b0e61dd5d9d8e8bb9aca618ef7.webp?t=1773286131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras_big/1f2984b0e61dd5d9d8e8bb9aca618ef7.webp?t=1773286131 width=800 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 Runes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 7 Shaping skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 100+ Charmstones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Full Challenge Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 Runes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 Shaping skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 70+ Charmstones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 13 Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Partial Challenge Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The demo's save file is local and independent. A new journey will begin when you purchase the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- We are still working hard to polish and optimize the game, so the content may be updated as development progresses. Thank you for your understanding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3248110?t=1773286131","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773286131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea